<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/august-24">24 August</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Alaric's Visigoths sack Rome</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/visigoths">Visigoths</a> under Alaric entered <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> and plundered it for three days, the first time the city had fallen to a foreign enemy in some 800 years. The shock prompted Augustine's City of God.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/visigoths">Visigoths</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
